#
# NEGF Step 2 + 3: 7-AGNR, L0 (2 periods) | C0 (2 periods) | R0 (2 periods)
# DFT-Tutorials OpenMX chapter 17
# One inner C atom of C0 (atom 12, x = 10.65, y = 11.23 Ang) replaced by N (substitutional donor).
# N_PBE19: 5 electrons -> 2.5 2.5. The leads are the pristine Step 1 leads.
# x ranges: L0 0.00-7.10, C0 8.52-15.62, R0 17.04-24.14 Ang ; ribbon in the xy plane, z = 6 Ang.
#

System.CurrrentDirectory      ./
System.Name                   negf-7agnr-n
DATA.PATH                     /path/to/openmx4.0/DFT_DATA19   # EDIT: absolute path containing PAO/ and VPS/
level.of.stdout               1
level.of.fileout              1

Species.Number                3
